{title: My Redeemer Lives}
{song_number: 140}
{language: en}
{artist: Reuben Morgan}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[E7]I know He rescued my soul, [A]His blood has covered my sins. [E7]I believe, [A]I believe.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[E7]My shame He's taken away, [A]my pain is healed in His name. [E7]I believe, [A]I believe.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[B]I'll raise the banner, [E]‘cause my Lord has conquered the grave. [A]My Redeemer lives, [C#m7]my Redeemer lives.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[D]You lift my burdens, [F#m7]I'll rise with You. [Bsus4]I'm dancing on this mountain top to see Your Kingdom come. [D]My Redeemer lives!
{end_of_bridge}
